🏛 Museum Tours

Museum Tours is an interactive platform that transforms how visitors experience museums. From curated self-guided tours and personalized exhibits, it helps culture lovers explore history, art, and science at their own pace.

---

✨ Key Features

- 🗺 Interactive Map Navigation  
  Easily find exhibits, rest areas, gift shops, and cafes using a smart indoor map.

- 📚 Personalized Tour Paths  
  Choose themed routes — from Ancient Civilizations to Modern Art — tailored to your interests and time.

- 📝 Digital Exhibit Notes  
  Save and review highlights of your visit, including artworks, artifacts, and facts that caught your attention.

- 🌍 Multilingual Support  
  Enjoy tours in multiple languages for a truly global museum experience.

---

🎯 Vision


To make museum visits more accessible, engaging, and personalized for everyone — from solo travelers and students to families and art lovers.

---

👥 Ideal Users

- 🧒 Students & educators  
- 👨‍👩‍👧‍👦 Families on cultural outings  
- 🧳 Tourists and solo travelers  
- 🎨 Art, history, and science enthusiasts

---

📌 Future Roadmap

- Integration with museum membership benefits  
- Augmented reality exhibit interactions  
- Virtual tours for remote visitors

